= The end of PxC

The far-right, xenophobic party of PxC has officially been dissolved. After time and time again failing to get any meaningful representation, the party direction has merged into VOX, though not all in the party have followed that path. Some have gone their separate way and formed the FNC. Let's hope they stay as irrelevant as they have been so far.
